  <item>
    <title>亲子沟通让我们迎难而上吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65cf74d63af97665afeea761</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65cf74d63af97665afeea761</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Feb 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> &nbsp;过年回家和父母沟通，幸福多还是困扰多？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> &nbsp;为什么我们和父母的沟通中总是充满“误解”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> &nbsp;沟通的氛围极度影响沟通效果！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> &nbsp;“训话式” VS “开放式”，我们渴望怎样的互动？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> &nbsp;矛盾的高潮来了，“教育”与“被教育”，究竟听谁的道理？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> &nbsp;多一点陪伴，让沟通有了相互理解的前提</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> &nbsp;父母和小孩，都是第一次成为的角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a> &nbsp;“人是可以改变的吗？” 身边也有成功案例！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> &nbsp;坚持主观能动性+放下防备+敞开心扉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2834">47:14</a> &nbsp;先成为一个合格的倾听者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> &nbsp;让父母通过第三方来了解自己，也是有用的途径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> &nbsp;明亮作为新一代妈妈，会非常重视给予孩子“情绪价值”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> &nbsp;希望和我们的小孩一起长大</span></p>]]></description>
