  <item>
    <title>职场里和老板那些阴晴圆缺，悲喜交加的关系</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/659670061519ccb1039b3304</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">659670061519ccb1039b3304</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jan 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> &nbsp;孟羽童和格力，董宇辉和新东方，“梦幻”职场故事的不同走向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> &nbsp;面对职场摩擦，你的处理风格是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> &nbsp;主动沟通是帮老板解决问题的第一步！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> &nbsp;理想的老板是什么模样？“Humanity-真善美”&amp;“职业精神/专业精神”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> &nbsp;对工作的合理期待的定义是什么？如何面对“我想要”和“我得到”的差异；“工作不负责激情”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> &nbsp;不同代际职场人对“回报”与“感恩”的不同理解；不同时代背景下，“努力吃苦”好像已经与向上流动无关了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2297">38:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;不同性别老板的不同特质；“她性领导力”——全面性、同理心和复原力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2605">43:25</a> &nbsp;95后职场人有可能和老板成为朋友吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">56:30</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;有必要“向上管理”吗，黄金法则是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3761">62:41</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;如果有一天自己成了老板，会怎样去管理和员工之间的关系......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">65:00</a> &nbsp;保护好才气，创造力，愿职场关系里也有人文关怀</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Let It Go (From "Frozen"/Soundtrack Version)</span></p>]]></description>
