    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> &nbsp;在阳光明媚的安福路上吃一顿Brunch~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">03:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;我们渴望从"Brunch"里获得怎样的情绪价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> &nbsp;健康轻盈多样化食物是Gaga类型餐厅的致胜法宝？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="718">11:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;全日段餐厅是怎样培养消费者的回购习惯的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1198">19:58</a> &nbsp;Bistro的重心是菜品还是酒水?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">24:04</a> &nbsp;Bistro是一个具有丰富情感流动的空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">27:37</a> &nbsp;"Bistro"的老家在巴黎，家常小酒馆的前世今生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">32:48</a> &nbsp;“中国的Bistro”是什么？Bistro的氛围感成本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">37:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;英国不同风格的小酒馆区别是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2508">41:48</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;“稳定”——影响Fine Dinning 体验的重要因素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2811">46:51</a> &nbsp;丫丫的中餐Fine Dinging 餐厅推荐——杭州金沙厅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2891">48:11</a> &nbsp;关于米其林的一个冷知识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a> &nbsp;明亮的怀石料理体验，珍贵的“食材”本味</span></p>]]></description>
