  <item>
    <title>“租房”or“买房”，围城内外各有烦恼</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6541b7a76c393dcb4f546f26</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6541b7a76c393dcb4f546f26</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Nov 2023 02:27:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> Catchup|香港典亚艺术博览会&amp;城市观察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 遇到了电话诈骗，提高反诈意识很重要！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 返璞归真的海岛假期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 切入正题，90/95后买房调查，父母存款竟是年轻人买房首付最大来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">16:57</a> 围城内外各有烦恼&amp;幸福，买房和租房的pros&amp;cons</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a> 不考虑金钱因素，买房还是租房？畅想梦中情房，Aranya社区引发的邻里关系思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2131">35:31</a> 一秒打回现实~房价过高触发一系列社会问题，e.g 加剧贫富差距，削弱消费力，生育率降低&amp;专家建言如何解决房价过高问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2447">40:47</a> 一部分不想纠结的年轻人过上了一种新型生活方式，关于民宿，旅居和数字游民社区...</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：我还年轻 我还年轻-老王乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>References：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://36kr.com/p/1670979441237768" data-url="https://36kr.com/p/1670979441237768"><span>2022年轻人买房报告：“30岁买房”的梦想，六成90后没能实现</span></a></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_13100525" data-url="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_13100525"><span>尹稚：对当下中国住宅问题的几点思考_澎湃号·政务_澎湃新闻-The Paper</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://finance.sina.com.cn/china/2023-04-08/doc-imypstnz8326908.shtml" data-url="https://finance.sina.com.cn/china/2023-04-08/doc-imypstnz8326908.shtml"><span>张斌：高房价背后的问题辨析_新浪财经_新浪网 (sina.com.cn)</span></a></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_13185151" data-url="https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_13185151"><span>盛松成：解决房价过高需要“挤泡沫”而非“刺破泡沫”_澎湃号·媒体_澎湃新闻-ThePaper</span></a></p>]]></description>
