  <item>
    <title>用遛弯的方式解锁我爱的秋天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/652e3e6305548bc4b22a5b1d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">652e3e6305548bc4b22a5b1d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Oct 2023 07:57:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一档由两位95后职场姑娘一起忙里偷闲制作的新节目，本期让我们一起来聊聊在伦敦、北京、上海的City Walk 记忆，也希望大家在舒爽的秋季都能享受属于自己的散步时光~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> &nbsp;“南南北北”播客名字的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> &nbsp;两位主播明亮和丫丫，跨越南北的友谊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> &nbsp;秋日初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> &nbsp;南瓜、秋月梨、枣泥拉糕，属于秋季的甜糯美味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1196">19:56</a> &nbsp;一年一度万圣节点灯仪式，星巴克万圣节特调星冰乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1461">24:21</a> &nbsp;City Walk为啥能爆火，通勤路上的你我是city walker吗?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1707">28:27</a> &nbsp;明亮的天津五大道city walk route</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1954">32:34</a> &nbsp;丫丫的北京五道营胡同city walk route</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2174">36:14</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;每天路过大本钟的伦敦散步路线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2809">46:49</a> &nbsp;通过散步来进行“附近的”、“邻里的”的城市街区观察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3413">56:53</a> &nbsp;“想和你一起走到天荒地老”，散步是恋爱最高级的一种浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3674">61:14</a> &nbsp;和妈妈一起散步，解锁母女间的温馨聊天密码</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4009">66:49</a> 科学证明：走起来能降低皮质醇，缓解馋嘴症，身心愉悦</span></p>]]></description>
